n, not just normal noise.\"},{\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Review disposition: accepted the blocking resolver critique by tying resolutionSource, resolutionSourceUrl, resolutionRule, and sourceContext to the canonical ALFRED/FRED REVOLSLAR first-vintage binding while preserving the substance that the statistic is the Federal Reserve G.19 first print; accepted the optional clarifications on the 2024-Jan through 2026-May reference class and sigma as the sample standard deviation of monthly annual-rate values.\"},{\"kind\":\"forecast\",\"point\":3.8,\"ciLow\":-2.6,\"ciHigh\":10.2}]}"}}
